# The recipes of the fights: what a fight's great moments are made of, in
# the words of the language.

# The finishing blow: time slowed, the screen white, the move; the one
# struck faints, and the music falls silent a moment over them.
define finish who:pokemon target:pokemon move...
  who face target
  tempo 0.5
  flash white
  who attack move at target
  tempo 1
  target faint
  volume 0
  wait 1s
  volume 1
end
